  ('f37ef7fe-c43c-513b-85ed-a640c92fcc1d', '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222221', 'short', 'The ''empty bottles'' metaphor illustrates that people feel a pressure to ______. [A] update their to-do lists [B] make passing time fulfilling [C] carry their plans through [D] pursue carefree reading 25', null, '[B] make passing time fulfilling（让流逝的时间变得充实）', '原文核心内容：作者Gary Eberle在《神圣时间》一书中将时间比作"不同大小的瓶子"（days,
hours, minutes）.人们感到有压力要"填满"这些瓶子（fill these bottles）.如果让时间流逝而没有"填满"，
